{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "35efa9fe-bba7-8be1-b4e8-ada9b55d1971",
  "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:38:40-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Peggy Quinn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T15:36:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T15:36:55-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, Denise. Good afternoon to you, and I hope you are having a pleasant Tuesday. My name is Peggy Quinn. Thank you for taking my call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T15:37:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, Mrs. Quinn. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T15:37:08-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, God bless you. I am calling about the recycling. The truck did not take my bin this morning. It is the second miss in a row, you see. Two weeks now it has stayed at the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T15:37:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry about that. Was the bin out by the usual time? Sometimes they tag it if there's something in it that doesn't belong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T15:37:28-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, it was out early. And there is a paper tag on it, but it is very small and I cannot read the writing. So this is my question. What can go in the recycling now? I am told the rules changed. The pizza boxes, the glass, and those plastic clamshells from the berries."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T15:37:45-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Clean pizza boxes are usually fine, but if they're greasy with cheese stuck on, that part goes in the trash. Glass jars and bottles are generally fine, rinsed. The clamshells are the tricky one. Check the number on the bottom, and if you're not sure, leave it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T15:38:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. So the clamshells I should not put. Perhaps that was the problem. I had them in there, and the boxes also, with the grease."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T15:38:08-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That could be it. Take those out, put the bin back out on your next day, and if they skip it again, call me back and I'll send a note to the crew."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T15:38:18-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Denise, you are very kind. I will do that. I only wanted to understand, because I have started a puzzle book to keep my mind sharp, and I thought, now I must learn this properly also."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T15:38:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, you're doing great. Anything else today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T15:38:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is everything. Thank you again, and have a blessed afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T15:38:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mrs. Quinn. Bye now."
    }
  ],
